==Battleground==
*2 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*20 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Raynard]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Wild Doge]] spawns.
**1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns.
**1 [[Cadaver Bear]] spawns.
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is rather simple if you know what you are doing. If you don't, you'll most likely struggle. At the start, you can stall the first 2 Teacher Bears quite easily with [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Mohawk]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser]]. If you want, you can completely stall out all the Wild Doges so they won't come out after base hit, having [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and a decent-leveled [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] will make dealing with them easy, but also keeping said Wild Doges alive will allow you to use them as stepping stones for your [[:Category:Long Distance Cats]].

Once you are ready to attack the base, send out your rushers, LD units, and [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]] to take out Raynard and Teacher Bear. If you don't manage to initially kill the Ursamajor, that shouldn't be much of a problem as long as you take him out before you fight all 3 bears. A 350% Cadaver Bear may sound scary, but as long as it doesn't get backup or not, it shouldn't be an issue as your rushers are dealing with it. The Fallen Bear comes out relatively late and shares a range with the other bears, so he shouldn't add much extra pressure if the Cadaver Bear is still around.

With [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]'s [[Explosion]] [[Talents|Talent]], this stage becomes rushable. By having Bahamut hit the base and then pinning Ursamajor with Green Shell Cat, Bahamut's Explosion will instantly kill Raynard and leave you with enough free time to destroy the base before Cadaver Bear makes it all the way to your base. Add units to speed up the destruction of the base like [[Bullet Train Cat]] and [[Awakened Naala]] and the million-health base gets easily destroyed.

==Trivia==
*Since most [[The Edge of Spacetime]] stages are named after concepts in physics, Zero Horizon may refer to an [[wikipedia:Event horizon|event horizon]].

